@startuml
actor User
participant Client
participant Backend
participant "Spring Security" as Sec

User -> Client : Submit credentials / OTP
Client -> Backend : POST /api/auth/login
Backend -> Sec : Authenticate and create JWT
Sec --> Backend : Auth result
Backend -> Client : JWT

Client -> Backend : API call with JWT
Backend -> Sec : Validate JWT, load roles
Sec --> Backend : SecurityContext with roles
Backend --> Client : Authorised response
@enduml

